      "writtenOn": "2022-11-29T22:07:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "returning a static string is used a lot, so maybe it\u0027s good to have a conversion like\n\n```\nimpl From\u003c\u0026str\u003e for CommandError {\n    fn from(s: \u0026str) -\u003e CommandError {\n        CommandError::Failed(String::from(s))\n    }\n}\n```\n\nso that returning static error message can simply be:\n```\nreturn Err(\"GATT client is not yet registered.\".into());\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 904,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 906,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "92d77e561e4a00eb4d39472c09c5233b160966ea",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
